.com/banners/v4/episode/10559635/screencap/675c7994c66d3.jpg"},{"title":"Flowers","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17954","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163146","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54865","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"131041","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"408629","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87933","synopsis":"As Aiku looks back on why he converted to a defender, the U-20s uses their specialty quick attack. Reo copies Nagi's skill to hold them off. Isagi yields the last step to Rin, which is stolen by Barou who has waited for the chance in the dark.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10559636/screencap/67660a1631535.jpg"},{"title":"Not Alone","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17954","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163146","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54865","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"131041","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"408629","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"87936","synopsis":"Seeing the players' upgrade, Sae takes the play to the next level. In response, Rin starts to align his thought process to Sae and drastically changes his play style . Then Rin realizes that Blue Lock players have been keeping up with his play.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10559637/screencap/67703546ba73d.jpg"},{"title":"Last Attack","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17954","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163146","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54865",